      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{63db69f414069d0bb68d4038|full_name} You put it well. I feel that for the time being this is the best outcome for all parties.\n\nIt's been clear to me that items/accessories will not be a free distributable thing like avatars anymore- not after we all saw how much money it all made, and how fast it did so. Which is probably the main reason for the hold up. I see no reality where they can reliably go back from that.",
